What:		/sys/devices/platform/applesmc.768/light_millilux
Date:		August 2026
Contact:	Linux hardware monitoring mailing list <linux-hwmon@vger.kernel.org>
Description:
		Room illuminance reported by a 10-byte Apple SMC ALV0 key,
		converted from its unsigned FP18.14 representation to millilux.
		This attribute is unavailable on machines with a different ALV0
		format.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/applesmc.768/light_raw
Date:		August 2026
Contact:	Linux hardware monitoring mailing list <linux-hwmon@vger.kernel.org>
Description:
		Decoded fields from a 10-byte Apple SMC ALV0 key. The five decimal
		values are valid, high_gain, channel0, channel1, and the unscaled
		FP18.14 room-illuminance value. This attribute is unavailable on
		machines with a different ALV0 format.
